# the stage: wherever Mister Wiggles is out (Sing, the Voice's Sound and Envelope, FX's karaoke room) he stands on the
# bottom bar in front of the CRT wall; the bars' colours carry the state; the song's words move into the bottom bar
# while it plays. FX is the karaoke room: white keys punch in, black keys play the track, SELECT turns the knobs' banks
expect page Sing
expect track Voice
wait 300
shot 01-sing-stopped
tap PLAY
wait 1500
expect playing 1
shot 02-sing-playing
# a knob turned while it plays: the strip shows a moment
turn K1 2
wait 100
shot 03-sing-knob
turn K1 -2
tap PLAY
expect playing 0
# the Voice's Sound page: the stage too
tap EDIT
expect page Sound
shot 04-sound-voice
# FX: the karaoke room, said on entering and leaving
tap FX
expect page Karaoke
expect msg ENTERING KARAOKE ROOM
expect button_led FX 1
expect key_led 0 1
expect key_led 7 1
expect key_led 2 0
wait 1500
shot 05-room
# the black keys play the selected track: the Voice sings, ALGORITHM still picks the track
key 8
wait 400
expect sung 1
shot 06-voice-note
turn ALGO 1
expect track Keys
key 13
wait 60
shot 07-keys-note
wait 600
turn ALGO -1
expect track Voice
# a white key held: its effect, its name in the top bar
keydown 0
wait 500
expect punch 0 1
shot 08-lo-pass
keyup 0
expect punch 0 0
keydown 2
wait 300
shot 09-hi-pass
keyup 2
keydown 4
wait 200
shot 10-gameboiii
keyup 4
keydown 6
wait 300
shot 11-ring-mod
keyup 6
tap PLAY
wait 800
expect playing 1
keydown 11
wait 410
expect punch 6 1
shot 12-chop-32
keyup 11
keydown 12
wait 300
expect punch 7 1
shot 13-chop-64
keyup 12
keydown 14
wait 200
shot 14-brrr-8
keyup 14
keydown 19
wait 200
shot 15-brrr-64
keyup 19
# build: a snare roll speeding up and a riser on everything but the Voice; let go, the drop
keydown 21
wait 2500
expect punch 12 1
shot 16-build
keyup 21
wait 80
shot 17-drop
keydown 23
wait 200
shot 18-crush
keyup 23
keydown 24
wait 200
shot 19-lo-fi
keyup 24
keydown 26
wait 900
shot 20-tape-off
keyup 26
# several held: their pictures mixed, their names piled in the top bar
keydown 16
keydown 23
keydown 24
wait 400
expect punch 9 1
expect punch 13 1
expect punch 14 1
shot 21-pile
keyup 16
keyup 23
keyup 24
tap PLAY
expect playing 0
# every knob turned in the room throws its own picture
turn K1 3
wait 120
shot 21b-turn-reverb
turn K1 -3
turn K3 3
wait 200
shot 21c-turn-delay
turn K3 -3
# SELECT turns the banks, the speakers change colour: FILTER (the master) night and day, DRIVE
turn SELECT 1
shot 22-bank-master
turn K4 -40
wait 400
shot 23-night
turn K4 80
wait 400
shot 24-day
turn K4 -40
turn K1 60
wait 100
shot 25a-turn-drive
wait 1400
shot 25-drive
turn K1 -60
# the voice banks: EDGE fires lasers while he sings, VIBRATO waves the wall
turn SELECT 1
turn K3 80
key 15 400
shot 26-edge
turn K3 -80
turn SELECT 1
turn K2 80
wait 300
shot 27-vibrato
turn K2 -80
turn SELECT -3
# leaving: said, and Sing again
tap HOME
expect page Sing
expect msg EXITING KARAOKE ROOM
wait 1500
# FX held alone: its card
down FX 1800
shot 28-card
up FX
expect page Karaoke
tap HOME
# no autosave: a change stays unsaved, SAVE lit, until SAVE
wait 6000
expect dirty 1
expect button_led SAVE 1
# OCT on Keys: the whole track an octave up, then back
turn ALGO 1
tap OCT+
expect msg OCTAVE +1
tap OCT-
turn ALGO -1
# GLO's list: RESET KNOBS puts every knob back to a new song's, after a question
tap GLO
tap SEL
tap SEL
tap SEL
expect msg KNOBS RESET
wait 1500
tap HOME
wait 500
# the Voice's OCT: its register by name
tap OCT-
expect msg BARITONE
tap OCT+
tap OCT+
expect msg ALTO
tap OCT-
